","v464":"Tompkins Cortland Community College Non-Disclosure Agreement This is a Nondisclosure Agreement made as of _______________________ ("Effective Date") between Tompkins Cortland Community College, an educational corporation organized and existing under the New York State Education Law, herein after referred to as "Tompkins Cortland Community College, a member of the State University of New York, with its principal place of business at 170 North Street, PO Box 139, Dryden NY 13053, and _______________ (“Company”), a ______________ corporation with its principal place of business at _______________________________________________________ for the purpose of protecting and preserving the confidential and/or proprietary nature of information to be disclosed or made available by Tompkins Cortland Community College to the Company under this Agreement.","v463":{"end":854,"field":"source_text","id":0,"public_sentence_id":0,"start":0,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v464"}},"v466":"For purposes of this Agreement Tompkins Cortland Community College and Company are sometimes collectively referred to as the “Parties” and individually referred to as a “Party”.","v465":{"end":1032,"field":"source_text","id":7,"public_sentence_id":7,"start":854,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v466"}},"v468":"As used herein, “Recipient” shall mean the Party who has been given “Confidential Information” (as hereinafter defined) by and of the other Party.","v467":{"end":1179,"field":"source_text","id":8,"public_sentence_id":8,"start":1032,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v468"}},"v469":{"end":1264,"field":"source_text","id":9,"public_sentence_id":9,"start":1179,"text":"Discloser shall mean the Party who gives Confidential Information to the other Party."},"v471":"1. The Parties agree to use the Confidential Information received hereunder solely for the purpose of performing the service or services for which the Company and Tompkins Cortland Community College have made an agreement (“Purpose”), and only to the extent necessary for the stated Purpose.","v470":{"end":1557,"field":"source_text","id":10,"public_sentence_id":10,"start":1265,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v471"}},"v473":"The Recipient agrees that it will not provide Confidential Information to any third parties or business partners without prior written agreement from Tompkins Cortland Community College.","v472":{"end":1743,"field":"source_text","id":11,"public_sentence_id":11,"start":1557,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v473"}},"v475":"2. “Confidential Information” means any business and/or personally identifiable information relating to Tompkins Cortland Community College's students, employees or other parties contained in files or storage systems to which the Company will be provided access by Tompkins Cortland Community College.","v474":{"end":2045,"field":"source_text","id":12,"public_sentence_id":12,"start":1744,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v475"}},"v477":"3. “Confidential Information” shall include, without limitation, printed or electronically recorded matter, personally identifiable information, customer and employee information, business information, and other information of a non-public nature.","v476":{"end":2294,"field":"source_text","id":13,"public_sentence_id":13,"start":2046,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v477"}},"v479":"Confidential Information also includes information generated as a result of the activities of the parties hereunder, and information whether disclosed in writing or orally, that is marked “confidential” or should be deemed by its nature to be confidential.","v478":{"end":2550,"field":"source_text","id":14,"public_sentence_id":14,"start":2294,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v479"}},"v481":"4. All Confidential Information shall remain the property of Tompkins Cortland Community College.","v480":{"end":2649,"field":"source_text","id":15,"public_sentence_id":15,"start":2551,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v481"}},"v483":"No rights or license therein is granted except a limited right to use the Confidential Information solely for the Purpose.","v482":{"end":2771,"field":"source_text","id":16,"public_sentence_id":16,"start":2649,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v483"}},"v485":"5. The Company agrees that for Confidential Information it shall use the same degree of care and means it utilizes to protect its own information of a similar nature, but in any event not less than reasonable care and means, to prevent unauthorized use or disclosure of such Confidential Information to third parties.","v484":{"end":3090,"field":"source_text","id":17,"public_sentence_id":17,"start":2772,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v485"}},"v486":{"end":3315,"field":"source_text","id":18,"public_sentence_id":18,"start":3090,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v20"}},"v487":{"end":3403,"field":"source_text","id":19,"public_sentence_id":19,"start":3316,"text":"6. This Agreement shall be effective on the date of its full execution by the Parties."},"v489":"Upon request of Tompkins Cortland Community College, the Company shall promptly return all copies of the Confidential Information, in whatever form or media, to Tompkins Cortland Community College, or certify the destruction of all such Confidential Information.","v488":{"end":3665,"field":"source_text","id":20,"public_sentence_id":20,"start":3403,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v489"}},"v491":"7. All notices shall be in writing and delivered by hand or sent by certified or registered mail, return receipt requested, or reputable overnight courier service to the above address of the other party, to the attention of the Recipient’s Legal Department unless otherwise directed in writing by Recipient, and shall be deemed received on the earlier of actual receipt or five days after deposit in the mail.","v490":{"end":4075,"field":"source_text","id":21,"public_sentence_id":21,"start":3666,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v491"}},"v493":"8. If any of this Agreement is held to be unenforceable, such unenforceable part 