pute amicably within sixty (60) Days of commencement of the negotiations, the dispute shall be settled through arbitration.","v1427":{"end":5454,"field":"source_text","id":43,"public_sentence_id":43,"start":5293,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v1428"}},"v1429":{"end":5536,"field":"source_text","id":44,"public_sentence_id":44,"start":5454,"text":"Arbitration shall be performed in accordance with the UNCITRAL arbitration rules."},"v1431":"One (1) sole arbitrator shall be appointed who shall have full powers to make final and binding decisions.","v1430":{"end":5643,"field":"source_text","id":45,"public_sentence_id":45,"start":5536,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v1431"}},"v1432":{"end":5726,"field":"source_text","id":46,"public_sentence_id":46,"start":5643,"text":"The appointing authority shall be the Permanent Court of Arbitration at The Hague."},"v1434":"The place of arbitration shall be Vienna and the language used in the arbitration proceedings shall be English.","v1433":{"end":5837,"field":"source_text","id":47,"public_sentence_id":47,"start":5726,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v1434"}},"v1436":"7 AMENDMENT No modification, amendment or change to this Confidentiality Agreement, or waiver of any of its provisions, or any additional contractual relationship with the Recipient shall be valid unless approved in the form of a written amendment to this Confidentiality Agreement, signed by a fully authorized representative of each Party.","v1435":{"end":6179,"field":"source_text","id":48,"public_sentence_id":48,"start":5838,"text":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v1436"}},"v1438":"8 ENTRY INTO FORCE This Confidentiality Agreement shall enter into force on the date of the last signature by or on behalf of both Parties and shall remain in force for a period of five (5) years, notwithstanding any earlier purported termination of this Confidentiality Agreement for whatever reason.","v1437":{"end":6481,"field":"source_text","id":50,"public_sentence_id":50,"start":6180,"text":{"__lsg